OL,3,GNEWSAEmpty railway arches to be turned 
OL,4,Ainto businesses                        
OL,6,FMore of Worcester's "iconic" railway   
OL,7,Farches are to get a new lease of life. 
OL,9,FCity councillors have approved plans to
OL,10,Fregenerate 12 empty arches on Cherry   
OL,11,FTree Walk, Infirmary Walk and Farrier  
OL,12,FStreet.                                
OL,14,FWide-ranging planning uses mean the    
OL,15,Funits could become wine bars,          
OL,16,Ftakeaways, shops, indoor sports or     
OL,17,Ffitness centres, restaurants, health   
OL,18,Fservices or small manufacturing        
OL,19,Fbusinesses.                            
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
