OL,3,GNEWSAEmpty railway arches to be turned 
OL,4,Ainto businesses                        
OL,6,FThe development by The Arch Company    
OL,7,FProperties Ltd forms part of the wider 
OL,8,FArches project, which has already seen 
OL,9,Fthe transformation of a number of      
OL,10,Farches between Foregate Street and the 
OL,11,Friver.                                 
